SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Alykes Karyoton
LOCATION:Alykes Karyoton\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hamlet of Alykes Karyoton\, just above the lagoon on the way from town to Karya\, holds its panigiri for Agios Panteleimon on the evening of 26 July in the churchyard\, with a live orchestra\, grilled meat and wine from the local association. Small and friendly\, part of the municipal summer programme.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#alykes-karyoton-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-alykes-karyoto
